"SPHEREx Data Release 1 spectral images: DOI 10.26131/IRSA678; DR1 spectral all-sky cube: DOI 10.26131/IRSA679.": "Images spectrales SPHEREx Data Release 1 : DOI 10.26131/IRSA678 ; cube spectral de tout le ciel DR1 : DOI 10.26131/IRSA679.",
